̂n\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>已經<rt>이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>決定<rt>괃ˆ뎽-</rt></ruby><ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>做<rt>죄ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一个<rt>짇에-</rt></ruby><ruby>善良<rt>셴령ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>歹囝<rt>팰ˆ걀ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà î-kiēng-koât-tieng-bêh-joè-jit-e-sien-lióng’e phâ̰i-kià̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>薰<rt>훈ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>매<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>食<rt>쟣ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>酒<rt>쥬ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>焦<rt>다ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hûn mài-kôh-jiâh, jiù boe-kôh-tâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>想<rt>슐-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby title=\"hît\">彼<rt>힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>暗<rt>암</rt></ruby> <ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>린<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>兜<rt>ᄃᅷˆ-</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>亭仔跤<rt>톙아ˆ카ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ-lì’e hît-am ti-lîn-tâu’e thieng-â-khâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>想<rt>슐-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby title=\"hît\">彼<rt>힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>暗<rt>암</rt></ruby> <ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>린<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>兜<rt>ᄃᅷˆ-</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>窗仔<rt>탕아ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>外<rt>꽈ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ-lì’e hît-am ti-lîn-tâu’e thang-â-goā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>想<rt>슐-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby title=\"hît\">彼<rt>힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>暗<rt>암</rt></ruby> <ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>린<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>兜<rt>ᄃᅷˆ-</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>亭仔跤<rt>톙아ˆ카ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ-lì’e hît-am ti-lîn-t